# Payment-provider integration documents. The 360 Finance / MongolID PDF carries
# sample credentials and endpoint detail; the repo root is web-served, so a
# committed copy would be downloadable from the live domain. Keep them out of
# git entirely rather than relying on nobody running `git add .`.
*.pdf
